{"id":"STm08_10","names":{"0":"","1":"","Domineering Desert Scorpion":"Domineering Desert Scorpion","Energetic Kid":"Energetic Kid","Standard Bearer":"Standard Bearer","avg1_103":"Amber","avg1_111":"Iris","avg1_112":"Noya","avg3_100":"Sylar","avg3_1297":"Desert Scorpion Grunt M","avg3_156":"Guardia Imperial bajito","avg3_170":"Chico del Distrito de las Cenizas","avg3_208":"Desert Scorpion Female Grunt","avg3_209":"Desert Scorpion Male Grunt","avg4_999":"Vita"},"en":{"0":"","1":"","Domineering Desert Scorpion":"Domineering Desert Scorpion","Energetic Kid":"Energetic Kid","Standard Bearer":"Standard Bearer","avg1_103":"Amber","avg1_111":"Iris","avg1_112":"Noya","avg3_100":"Sylar","avg3_1297":"Desert Scorpion Grunt M B","avg3_156":"Imperial Guard Shortstack","avg3_170":"Generic Ash District Boy","avg3_208":"Desert Scorpion Female Grunt","avg3_209":"Desert Scorpion Male Grunt","avg4_999":"Vita"},"tx":1,"steps":[["intro","Act Seven","First Encounter with Mirage","You share these forgotten memories with Iris, Noya, and Amber. Truth uncovered, your bond runs deeper than ever. Meanwhile, chaos engulfs Mirage as the Desert Scorpions close in on you."],["trn",0,0,false,false,0.0],["bg","story_main_01_037",0,0.0],["bg","carriage_inside",0,0.0],["trn",1,0,false,false,1.0],["show","avg3_100","h","025",null,-0.1,null,0,null,0.0],["se","se_024"],["head","08:00, Nebula Month 7th, Mirage, Lucky Oasis"],["ctl","avg3_100","h",null,null,null,0.0,null,1.0,null,"OutBack",0.7],["se","se_208"],["stg",0,null,null,1.05,"OutQuint",1.0,null,null,null],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg3_100","h","009","speechless",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",1.0],["say","1","Mmm... Where am I...?==W== Oh, right. We fell asleep once we made it to Mirage last night.",0,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["ctl","avg3_100","h",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["stg",0,null,null,1.1,"OutCubic",1.0,null,null,null],["ctl","avg3_100","h",null,null,null,null,1.1,0.0,null,"OutQuint",0.7],["hide","avg3_100",0.7],["w",0.3],["bgm","m62"],["se","se_024_stop"],["se","se_118"],["w",0.8],["fx",0,"fx_avg_speaking",0,2],["se","se_087"],["say","avg4_999","Good morning, Tyrant. Did you sleep well? Any dreams?",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"t","010","sigh",null],["say","avg3_100","Morning, Vita. I had a dream. A really long one.",1,""],["mrt",3,"t",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["say","avg4_999","Tyrant, may tonight's starlight and sweet dreams wash away the exhaustion for you and your companions.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"t","021","attention","lengzhan"],["say","avg3_100","Wait. You weren't behind that dream, were you?",1,""],["mrt",3,"t",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["say","avg4_999","I did no such thing, Tyrant. You and your companions agreed to try the Monolith Melody.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"s","003",null,"JuGong"],["se","se_077"],["say","avg3_100","I did,==W== but you told me it was regular sleep music.",1,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["mrt",3,"s",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["say","avg4_999","That melody was composed from records inside the Monolith.==W== If the listener resonates with those records, the music can awaken things they have forgotten.",0,""],["w",0.3],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"s","009","speechless","niunie1"],["say","avg3_100","Forgotten? But I didn't dream about my own past. I dreamt about Iris, Noya, and Amber...==W==",1,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["mrt",3,"s",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["se","se_226"],["trn",0,1,false,false,0.2],["w",0.2],["bg","story_main_08_001",0,0.0],["stg",0,null,null,null,"Linear",0.0,null,null,"JingTouYaoHuang"],["fx",0,"fx_avg_reminiscence_loop",0,2],["fx",0,"fx_avg_speaking",1,2],["cbg",0,-580.0,-100.0,1.4,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["w",0.3],["trn",1,1,false,false,0.3],["w",2.0],["trn",0,1,false,false,0.2],["w",0.2],["bg","story_main_01_037",0,0.0],["fx",0,"fx_avg_reminiscence_loop",1,2],["stg",0,null,null,null,"Linear",0.0,null,null,"stop"],["fx",0,"fx_avg_speaking",0,2],["w",0.3],["trn",1,1,false,false,0.3],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"s","025","exclamation","lengzhan"],["say","avg3_100","... Hold on. Are you saying...==W== I saw their memories? The ones they lost?",1,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["mrt",3,"s",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["say","avg4_999","Perhaps yes, perhaps no. The Monolith does hold memories offered by wish-makers, but those records contain more than that.",0,""],["say","avg4_999","Also, my apologies, but this melody was only a trial. You and your companions will forget the dream shortly after waking.",0,""],["say","avg4_999","If you are interested in the Monolith's records, please focus on the system mission \"Acquire a Monolith.\"==W== Once it is accomplished, I will pass on these melodies in a format that allows for repeated resonance.",0,""],["w",0.3],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"s","010","sweaty",null],["say","avg3_100","So that was the real goal all along. Pushing me to finish the mission.",1,""],["mrt",0,"t","014","attention","diantou"],["say","avg3_100","Fine. Don't worry about it.==W== As long as it gives me the power to protect everyone, I will get the task done.",1,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["mrt",3,"t",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["se","se_087"],["say","avg4_999","Your command is my will.==W== I will take my leave now. Safe travels, Tyrant.",0,""],["w",0.3],["goon"],["w",0.5],["fx",0,"fx_avg_speaking",1,2],["cbg",0,null,-100.0,null,"OutQuint",1.0,null,null,null],["stg",0,null,null,1.05,"OutCubic",1.0,null,null,null],["show","avg3_100","h","015",null,null,1.1,0,null,0.0],["w",0.3],["ctl","avg3_100","h",null,null,null,null,1.0,1.0,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["se","se_208"],["bgm",""],["w",0.7],["ctl","avg3_100","h","009","speechless",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","1","(\"Tyrant,\" huh... If everything Vita just said is true, then I...)==W==",0,""],["w",1.0],["goon"],["ctl","avg3_100","h",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["se","se_014"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_100","h","015",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",1.0],["stg",0,null,100.0,1.1,"OutCubic",1.0,null,null,null],["ctl","avg3_100","h",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"OutQuint",0.5],["hide","avg3_100",0.5],["se","se_342"],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_103","Morning, Boss.",0,""],["say","avg3_100","Oh, you're up. Morning, Amber.",0,""],["say","avg1_103","Been up for a while. Saw you talking to Vita, so I didn't interrupt. Just messing with my phone.",0,""],["say","avg1_103","Boss, can I ask you something? What was in your dream?",0,""],["say","avg1_103","",0,""],["show","avg1_103","g","007",null,-0.8,2.0,0,null,0.0],["say","avg3_100","I dreamt about you, Iris, and Noya as kids. Things like wanting to get jobs, reading on the Waterway bridge...",0,""],["ctl","avg1_103","g",null,null,null,-0.7,null,1.0,null,"OutBack",0.7],["se","se_074"],["say","avg3_100","And later on. Iris looking for jobs, Noya building Loxy, you going treasure hunting...",0,""],["se","se_100"],["stg",0,null,0.0,null,"OutQuint",0.5,null,null,null],["w",0.3],["mrt",1,"t","007","exclamation","lengzhan"],["say","avg3_100","Whoa, hey!==W== Amber, that's too close!",1,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["mrt",3,"t",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["stg",0,null,null,1.0,"OutCubic",1.0,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_103","g","006","flurry",null,-0.65,1.9,null,"niunie1","OutQuint",0.5],["say","avg1_103","Boss. Can you tell us the whole dream?==W== In detail.",0,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["bgm",""],["trn",0,0,false,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.0,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["clear",1,0,1],["w",1],["bg","carriage_inside",0,0.0],["trn",1,0,false,false,1.0],["show","avg1_111","d","018",0.35,null,null,0,null,0.0],["show","avg1_112","e","023",0.67,null,null,0,null,0.0],["bgm","m33"],["head","08:20, Nebula Month 7th, Mirage, Lucky Oasis"],["stg",0,null,null,1.05,"OutQuint",1.0,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_111","d",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["ctl","avg1_112","e",null,null,0.65,null,null,1.0,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["se","se_208"],["w",0.8],["ctl","avg1_112","e","010",null,null,null,null,null,"niunie1","Linear",1.0],["se","se_207"],["say","avg1_112","Yawn... Mornin'...==W==",0,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["ctl","avg1_111","d","016","vexation",null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_111","Noya, can you try to stay still in your sleep? Your leg was crushing me.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_112","e","015","flurry",null,null,null,null,"tiao2","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_112","Hey, blame Amber. She had me in a bear hug from behind.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_111","d","007","sweaty",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["show","avg1_103","g","002",null,-0.1,1.0,0,null,0.0],["say","avg1_111","Well she hugs me too, and you don't see me crushing anyone.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_112","e",null,null,0.7,null,null,null,null,"OutQuint",0.5],["ctl","avg1_111","d",null,null,0.3,null,null,null,null,"OutQuint",0.5],["ctl","avg1_103","g",null,null,null,-0.02,null,1.0,null,"OutBack",0.5],["se","se_236"],["say","avg1_103","Everyone feels different.==W== I grab whoever my mood finds fitting.",0,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["se","se_375"],["fx",0,"fx_avg_bubble",0,2],["bg","mood_1",0,0.5],["stg",0,null,20.0,1.1,"OutQuad",1.5,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_103","g","003",null,null,-0.12,1.2,null,null,"OutQuad",1.5],["ctl","avg1_112","e","006",null,null,null,null,null,null,"OutQuint",0.5],["ctl","avg1_111","d","006",null,null,null,null,null,null,"OutQuint",0.5],["say","avg1_103","Noya is warm.==W== Iris is squishy.==W==",0,""],["w",0.8],["goon"],["w",0.8],["goon"],["bg","carriage_inside",0,0.5],["stg",0,null,0.0,1.05,"OutQuint",0.5,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_103","g",null,null,null,-0.02,1.0,null,null,"OutQuint",0.5],["ctl","avg1_112","e",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"OutQuint",0.5],["ctl","avg1_111","d",null,"shock",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","OutQuint",0.5],["say","avg1_111","S-Squishy?!==W== Did I put on weight?!==W== Okay, listen up.==W== From now on, no one touches me in their sleep without my explicit permission.",0,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.2],["ctl","avg1_111","d","018",null,0.2,null,null,0.0,null,"InBack",0.55],["hide","avg1_111",0.55],["se","se_104"],["w",0.6],["chd",0,0,"avg1_111","d","019","resentful"],["goon"],["ctl","avg1_103","g","009",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["ctl","avg1_112","e","008",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["w",0.8],["goon"],["chd",1,0,"avg1_111","a","002",null],["cbg",0,50.0,null,null,"OutCubic",1.0,null,null,null],["stg",0,null,30.0,1.1,"OutCubic",1.0,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_112","e",null,null,0.62,null,null,null,null,"OutQuint",0.7],["ctl","avg1_103","g","011","sigh",0.38,null,null,null,null,"OutQuint",0.7],["say","avg1_103","Boss==W== is hard.",0,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"t","007","symbol",null],["say","avg3_100","H-Hard?!",1,""],["mrt",3,"t",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_103","g","012","vexation",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_103","Too bony.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_112","e","023","sweaty",null,null,null,null,"JuGong","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_112","See? You need to eat more, ==PLAYER_NAME==.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"t","010","flurry","niunie"],["say","avg3_100","Hold on, we're getting derailed.==W== Amber, weren't you asking about my dream?",1,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["mrt",3,"t",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_103","g","006",null,null,null,null,null,"JuGong","Linear",1.0],["ctl","avg1_112","e","006",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["se","se_077"],["say","avg1_103","We all need to know.==W== That's why I woke everyone up.==W== Do you remember your dreams last night?",0,""],["w",0.3],["goon"],["show","avg1_111","d","007",0.25,null,null,0,null,0.0],["w",0.8],["cbg",0,0.0,null,null,"OutQuint",1.0,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_103","g",null,null,0.5,null,null,null,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["ctl","avg1_112","e",null,null,0.7,null,null,null,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["ctl","avg1_111","d",null,null,0.3,null,null,1.0,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["se","se_074"],["goon"],["ctl","avg1_112","e","023","speechless",null,null,null,null,"niunie1","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_112","Dreams? I know I dreamt about something,==W== but it slipped my mind the second I woke up.",0,""],["w",0.8],["ctl","avg1_103","g","009",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["goon"],["ctl","avg1_112","e",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["ctl","avg1_111","d",null,"question",null,null,null,null,"ChanDou1","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_111","... W-Why the sudden subject change?==W== I don't remember the details either...==W== But I woke up feeling pretty good. Must have been a nice one.",0,""],["w",0.3],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_111","d","026","happy",null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",1.0],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"t","014",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Let me ask you something else. How much do you actually remember about the orphanage? Or what you did right after leaving, before you built Loxy?",1,""],["mrt",3,"t",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_103","g","011","vexation",null,null,null,null,"niunie","Linear",1.0],["ctl","avg1_111","d","015",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_103","The orphanage is a blur. I only remember Aunt Allie's face.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_112","e","006","attention",null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_112","I've got bits and pieces of what happened after we left. Like scavenging parts for Loxy.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_112","e","008","sweaty",null,null,null,null,"ChanDou1","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_112","But we were all doing our own thing back then. I draw a complete blank on how we actually teamed up to form the New Star Guild.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_111","d","004","speechless",null,null,null,null,"niunie1","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_111","The Monolith probably took those memories as payment for our wishes. The books say they feed on intense emotions...==W== And looking back, that was a nerve-wracking period of our lives.",0,""],["w",0.8],["goon"],["ctl","avg1_111","d","015","awkward",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_111","Rumor has it that if your prayer is even slightly vague, the Monolith takes extra memories as a toll.==W== I guess that's the price we had to pay for being rookies.",0,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["ctl","avg1_112","e","004","happy",null,null,null,null,"JuGong","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_112","Thank goodness we have Iris.==W== If it were up to me, I'd have botched every single wish and wiped my own brain by now.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_103","g","003",null,null,null,null,null,"daintou","Linear",1.0],["w",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"s","009","speechless","niunie1"],["say","avg3_100","So none of you remember your childhood.==W== Which means...==W== That dream I had... Those were your memories?",1,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.3],["goon"],["mrt",0,"s","014",null,"niunie1"],["se","se_208"],["say","avg3_100","Vita said I'd forget the dream as soon as I woke up, but my magic-immunity must have blocked the memory wipe.",1,""],["mrt",0,"t","003",null,"diantou"],["se","se_077"],["say","avg3_100","As for what I dreamt about...==W==",1,""],["ctl","avg1_103","g","002",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["ctl","avg1_111","d","009",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["ctl","avg1_112","e","006",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["w",0.8],["goon"],["mrt",3,"t",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,false,false,1.0],["w",1.5],["se","se_187"],["say","0","Half an hour later.",8,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_187_stop"],["ctl","avg1_103","g","007",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.0],["ctl","avg1_112","e","007",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.0],["ctl","avg1_111","d","006",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.0],["w",0.5],["trn",1,0,false,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg1_111","d","025","awkward",null,null,null,null,"ChanDou1","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_111","No way! That explains why I missed the mark by one point. The Monolith took my memory of the last exam when I made my wish.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_103","g","003","sigh",null,null,null,null,"JuGong","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_103","We should have made the wish instead.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_112","e","006",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",1.0],["se","se_077"],["say","avg1_112","Then you could've gone to Grace Light Academy.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_111","d","017","exclamation",0.38,null,1.05,null,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["ctl","avg1_103","g",null,null,0.6,null,null,null,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["ctl","avg1_112","e",null,null,0.8,null,null,null,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["stg",0,200.0,null,1.2,"OutQuint",1.0,null,null,null],["say","avg1_111","What are you talking about?==W== If I went off to college, I wouldn't be here traveling with you!",0,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["ctl","avg1_111","d","027","happy",null,null,null,null,"niunie1","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_111","Besides, failing that exam is how I ended up at Boss Accord. My dream of becoming a corporate employee came true anyway!==W== Missing that test must have been a sign from the God of Grace.",0,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"t","025","question",null],["say","avg3_100","You... You're all taking this surprisingly well. I thought ... you'd be way more upset or freaked out after hearing what you lost.",1,""],["mrt",3,"t",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["stg",0,0.0,null,1.1,"OutQuint",1.0,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_111","d",null,null,0.3,null,null,null,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["ctl","avg1_103","g",null,null,0.5,null,null,null,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["ctl","avg1_112","e","019","happy",0.7,null,null,null,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["say","avg1_112","Hehe, I guess it is a little scary when you think about it.==W== But whether we laugh or cry, we're facing the same reality.==W== We might as well laugh and cheer up.",0,""],["w",0.8],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_112","e","004","music",null,null,null,null,"Tiao","Linear",1.0],["goon"],["ctl","avg1_111","d","026","sigh",null,null,null,null,"JuGong","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_111","The second we chose to be Trekkers, we accepted the risk of losing our memories. Honestly, as long as the Monolith doesn't make me forget where I stashed my Dorra, I'm fine.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_103","g","002","attention",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_103","It already did. You found Dorra in your boot once and thought you hit the jackpot. You were thrilled.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_111","d","013",null,null,null,null,null,"niunie1","Linear",1.0],["se","se_208"],["say","avg1_111","Hey, drop it! Anyway, we have a soul pact with you now. Our wishes don't cost us memories anymore, so we have nothing to worry about.",0,""],["se","se_077"],["cbg",0,null,null,0.98,"OutQuint",1.0,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_112","e","005",null,0.5,-0.1,1.2,null,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["ctl","avg1_103","g",null,null,0.72,null,null,null,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["ctl","avg1_111","d",null,null,0.28,null,null,null,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["say","avg1_112","Oh, right.==W== ==PLAYER_NAME==, give me your hand.",0,""],["w",0.8],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"s","012","question",null],["say","avg3_100","Huh? What for?",1,""],["mrt",3,"s",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_112","e","007","attention",null,null,null,null,"JuGong","OutQuint",1.0],["say","avg1_112","You two, get in here.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_112","e","003","speechless",null,null,null,null,"niunie1","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_112","Because from here on out, life isn't an exam for three anymore.==W== It's an exam for all four of us.",0,""],["w",0.8],["goon"],["ctl","avg1_112","e",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["ctl","avg1_111","d","011",null,0.25,-0.1,1.2,null,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["se","se_077"],["say","avg1_111","I know we've said something similar before, but we mean it.==W== We're glad to have you with us, Boss.",0,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["ctl","avg1_103","g","005",null,0.75,-0.1,1.2,null,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["se","se_077"],["say","avg1_103","Talk to me more.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"t","022",null,"JuGong"],["se","se_077"],["say","avg3_100","Yeah. Together, we'll write our own answers.",1,""],["mrt",3,"t",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_112","e","019","happy",null,null,null,null,"tiao2","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_112","Exactly! Everyone's awake, so let's get moving. Mirage, here we come!",0,""],["w",0.5],["bgm",""],["trn",0,0,false,false,1.0],["w",1.5],["clear",1,0,1],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.0,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["bg","mirage_street_daylight",0,0.0],["w",0.5],["trn",1,0,false,false,1.0],["show","avg1_112","a","006",null,null,null,0,null,0.0],["bgm","m30"],["head","09:00, Nebula Month 7th, Mirage, Unnamed Street"],["stg",0,null,null,1.05,"OutQuint",1.0,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_112","a",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["se","se_062"],["w",0.8],["ctl","avg1_112","a",null,"speechless",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["show","avg1_111","a","004",0.28,null,null,0,null,0.0],["say","avg1_112","It was too dark to see much when we got here... This is Mirage? Looks like a typical desert city. Why call it the Edge of the World?",0,""],["ctl","avg1_112","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["ctl","avg1_111","a",null,null,0.3,null,null,1.0,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["se","se_062"],["stg",0,100.0,null,null,"OutQuint",1.0,null,null,null],["say","avg1_111","Most cities in Nova are built around Monoliths.==W== Mirage doesn't have one. There aren't any in the entire region.",0,""],["w",0.8],["goon"],["ctl","avg1_111","a","002",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",1.0],["se","se_077"],["say","avg1_111","That's why it's known as the land beyond Monoliths—==W==the Edge of the World.",0,""],["w",0.3],["show","avg1_103","c","002",0.72,null,null,0,null,0.0],["goon"],["stg",0,0.0,null,null,"OutQuint",1.0,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_103","c",null,"question",0.7,null,null,1.0,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["say","avg1_103","But why build a city==W== where there's no Monolith?",0,""],["w",0.3],["goon"],["ctl","avg1_111","a","004","sigh",null,null,null,null,"JuGong","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_111","There has to be a reason. I